olor\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$5,000</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Pre-release</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Tall Steel Pickaxe</b> is a pickaxe sold at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a> for $5,000. Despite the fact that <a href=\"/wiki/Tall_Steel_Axe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tall Steel Axe\">Tall Steel Axe</a> once had a short version of it, <b>Tall Steel Pickaxe</b> never had one.\n</p><p>A nice and affordable choice for intermediate players.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p><b>Tall Steel Pickaxe</b> is a tall hatchet made out of wood and steel. It's headpiece is dark gray in color and uses the default legacy metal texture. Handle, like any other axe, is made out of dark brown wood with default legacy wood material applied to it. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>It's axe counterpart is <a href=\"/wiki/Tall_Steel_Axe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tall Steel Axe\">Tall Steel Axe</a>.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260830082715\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time u